{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Nevada","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Nevada</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q133896320","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Nevada","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Nevada</span></span>"},"pageid":79606915,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/State_Seal_of_Nevada.svg/330px-State_Seal_of_Nevada.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/State_Seal_of_Nevada.svg/960px-State_Seal_of_Nevada.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":571,"height":571},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375989235","tid":"c2e9feca-b597-11f1-b643-64ea4d5606cd","timestamp":"2026-09-21T08:38:04Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Nevada"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Nevada will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the four U.S. representatives from the state of Nevada, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with the other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on June 9, 2026.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Nevada</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the four U.S. representatives from the state of Nevada, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with the other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on June 9, 2026.</p>"}